# Supabase — copy to .env and fill in to enable multiplayer mode.
# Without these the app runs in demo mode: a BroadcastChannel adapter that still
# syncs live between tabs in the same browser, with no account and no network.
#
# Both values are safe in client-side code. The anon/publishable key is designed
# to be public; Row Level Security in supabase/migrations is what actually
# enforces access. Never put a service_role / secret key here.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
